# Compiled into `npm run build`. Empty means the API is reached at `/api` on the same
# host the page came from — which is how smart.restaurant.aniruddhasali.in works: the
# domain serves this client and proxies /api and /socket.io to the Render service. Set it
# only for a client deployed on an address that cannot proxy the API, and never put
# secrets here: Vite inlines this file into the bundle the browser downloads.
VITE_API_URL=
